Here is the commit message:
ACCUMULO-3291 Use target instead of /tmp

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the use of a temporary folder located in `/tmp`, which can lead to issues with file management and cleanup during tests, especially in environments where multiple tests may run concurrently or where the `/tmp` directory may be cleaned up by the system. This could result in tests failing due to missing directories or files, leading to unreliable test outcomes.

